.TH QUIPU-REPORT 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-report \- Report graph hubs and questions, or public operational SLO history
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu report\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-predicate\fR] [\fB\-\-hubs\fR] [\fB\-\-surprises\fR] [\fB\-\-questions\fR] [\fB\-\-prometheus\fR] [\fB\-\-days\fR] [\fB\-\-end\fR] [\fB\-\-public\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report graph hubs and questions, or public operational SLO history
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Entity type IRI to select
.TP
\fB\-\-predicate\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate IRI used to filter facts or edges
.TP
\fB\-\-hubs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Number of hubs in the report
.TP
\fB\-\-surprises\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Number of surprising relationships in the report
.TP
\fB\-\-questions\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Number of suggested questions in the report
.TP
\fB\-\-prometheus\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Prometheus base URL for a public SLO report (no credentials in URL)
.TP
\fB\-\-days\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Public SLO report window in complete UTC days (1\-90; default 30)
.TP
\fB\-\-end\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Public SLO report end at a past RFC3339 UTC midnight
.TP
\fB\-\-public\fR
Read public operational SLO history without opening the graph
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
